  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this project is to improve the care of sick and premature newborn babies, in line with evidence based practice, in New Delhi, Delhi, and in Jaipur, Rajasthan. Furthermore, the project aims to provide Norwegian health personnel experience in diagnosis and treatment of patients in these areas that exceed the exposures they will get in Norway. The project also intends to increase multicultural understanding within newborn health care. India.</narrative>
  </description>
